<title>USA: Dennis Franz wins Emmy for best actor in a drama.</title>
<headline>Dennis Franz wins Emmy for best actor in a drama.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dennis Franz, star of the ABC show &quot;NYPD Blue&quot;, won the Emmy Award on Sunday for best actor in a drama series.</p>
